### Salud
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Calcular diagnostico
POST http://localhost:3000/api/calcular
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingresos_mensuales": 2500000,
  "gastos_mensuales": 2800000,
  "deuda_total": 42000000,
  "numero_acreedores": 3,
  "tiene_mora": true,
  "tipo_deuda": "consumo",
  "tipo_persona": "natural"
}

### Crear lead
POST http://localhost:3000/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Perez",
  "telefono": "3001112233",
  "correo": "ana@example.com",
  "ciudad": "Bogota",
  "calculo": {
    "ingresos_mensuales": 2500000,
    "gastos_mensuales": 2800000,
    "deuda_total": 42000000,
    "numero_acreedores": 3,
    "tiene_mora": true,
    "tipo_deuda": "consumo",
    "tipo_persona": "natural"
  }
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@avanzar.local",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### Usuario actual
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar leads
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leads?estado=nuevo&servicio_recomendado=insolvencia&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle lead
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leads/{{lead_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar estado
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/leads/{{lead_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "contactado",
  "comentario": "Contacto inicial realizado."
}

### Exportar CSV
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leads/export?fecha_desde=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
